Cadence English word pack (words-en-v1)
========================================

Contents: `words-en-v1.tsv` contains 25,000 alphabet-filtered frequency
tokens, with rank-based bands, recorded as extracted on 2026-10-08 by
`tools/corpus/dump_words.py`. This is not a vetted English dictionary.
It may contain names, abbreviations, offensive terms, and nonwords.
No comprehensive linguistic, safety, or source-by-source licence audit
is claimed. The loader validates syntax, alphabet, and distinct IDs/forms;
those checks do not establish suitability or lexicographic quality.

